  "learningObjectives": ["使用輾轉相除法求兩個正整數的最大公因數"],
  "prerequisites": ["while 迴圈", "取餘數"],
  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>計算兩個正整數的最大公因數（GCD）。</p><p>給定兩個正整數 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code>，請求出能同時整除兩者的最大整數。可以使用輾轉相除法（歐幾里得算法）：反覆以 <code>a, b = b, a % b</code> 更新，直到 <code>b</code> 為 0，此時的 <code>a</code> 即為答案。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>輾轉相除法只需要一個 while 迴圈，每次把 <code>a</code> 換成 <code>b</code>，把 <code>b</code> 換成 <code>a % b</code>。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>兩行，第一行是正整數 <code>a</code>，第二行是正整數 <code>b</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>一行，輸出 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 的最大公因數。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>1 ≤ a, b ≤ 1000</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "12\n18",
  "sampleOutput": "6",
  "samples": [
    { "input": "12\n18", "output": "6" },
    { "input": "101\n13", "output": "1" },
    { "input": "1\n1", "output": "1" }
  ],
  "testCases": [
    { "input": "12\n18", "output": "6" },
    { "input": "101\n13", "output": "1" },
    { "input": "1\n1", "output": "1" },
    { "input": "1000\n1000", "output": "1000" },
    { "input": "1\n1000", "output": "1" },
    { "input": "1000\n1", "output": "1" },
    { "input": "24\n36", "output": "12" },
    { "input": "17\n19", "output": "1" },
    { "input": "100\n75", "output": "25" },
    { "input": "7\n1000", "output": "1" }
  ],
